 R←Test_OnWait_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;qdmx
⍝ Exercise "SetOnWait" with text rather than a function as operand
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 C.UnsetOnWait
 :Trap 11
     '∆OnWaitSpy'C.SetOnWait 0
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp'The operand must be a function'≢qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠C.⎕NC'∆OnWait'

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 C.UnsetOnWait
⍝Done
